menu "ESP32-DATV-SA"

choice DATV_BOARD
    prompt "Board (front panel wiring)"
    default DATV_BOARD_SUPERMINI
    help
        Pins of the front panel OLED. The encoder (GPIO5/6/7), the buttons (GPIO10/20/21) and PA enable (GPIO3) are the same
        on both boards.

config DATV_BOARD_SUPERMINI
    bool "ESP32-C3 SuperMini (OLED SDA GPIO0, SCL GPIO1)"

config DATV_BOARD_XIAO_C3
    bool "Seeed XIAO ESP32-C3 (OLED SDA GPIO4 = D2, SCL GPIO2 = D0)"
    help
        The XIAO does not bring out GPIO0/1. SCL goes to the strapping pin GPIO2, which the bus pull-ups keep high at reset.

endchoice

endmenu
